 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "DOCTOR",
  "person_2": "PATIENT"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hi, come on in. Before we start, what would you like me to call you? Your chart says Danielle."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Oh, um, Dani is fine. Or, well, Danielle at work, but... Dani's good."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Dani it is. I'm Dr. Reyes. This is your follow-up on your treatment. How are you feeling overall?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Better, I think. Mostly. It's... well, it's hard to say."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Let's take it piece by piece. Is the cough still around?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A little. In the mornings, mostly. It's, um, not as bad as it was."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "How long has it been going on now?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Since... um. About three months, I guess? Maybe more."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. Any night sweats lately?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Those are gone. They stopped, like, a month ago. I used to wake up soaked, and now... nothing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good, that's a real sign of progress. What about energy?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm still tired. Like, I get home and I just...",
   "pause": 5
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go on."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I just can't do much. I fall asleep on the couch by eight."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That'll improve. Now, any coughing up blood?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "No. No blood."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Have you lost weight in the last month?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "No, I don't think so. Maybe I gained, actually."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Any chest pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "No... not really. No."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "You're on your medicine every day? Remind me of the dose."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yeah, the rifampin. 600 mg, once a day. In the morning, before I eat."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. How about your stomach and your general digestion, since starting it? Any trouble?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's fine. Nothing there."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Great. I see TB listed in your history, with the treatment about four months in. Does that match your memory?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes. Four months. It feels longer."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I bet. Any past surgery I should know about?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "My gallbladder. Um, it was taken out in 2015."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. Anyone in your family with TB or lung disease?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "My uncle had TB. A long time ago, in the old country. I think. I don't really know the details."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's fine. What work do you do, and who do you live with?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I work in a bakery. Early shifts. And I... I live with two roommates."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. Hop up on the table, and I'll listen to your lungs."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay.",
   "pause": 3
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Deep breath in, and out. Again.",
   "pause": 16
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Chest sounds clear on both sides. And the glands in your neck aren't swollen.",
   "pause": 8
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's good, right?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, that's good. Sit up. Keep the rifampin going, same dose, every morning, don't skip."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I won't. I haven't, I think... I mean, I haven't."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. Keep the bakery mask on, and tell your roommates to cover their coughs, too."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Oh. Yeah, they know. Okay."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll see you again in four weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Four weeks. Okay. Um, and if the cough...",
   "pause": 4
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "If it gets worse before then, call the clinic. Anything else, Dani?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "No, that's all. Thank you, Dr. Reyes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Take care. Front desk will book that visit."
  }
